WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.144
Welcome to MX Terminal.

00:00:04.144 --> 00:00:08.288
Every African market, one terminal.

00:00:08.288 --> 00:00:12.432
Johannesburg, Lagos, Nairobi and Cairo, end of day, in one workspace.

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:19.400
Sign in with Google, or create an account with your email and a password of at least eight characters.

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:23.552
This is the board.

00:00:23.552 --> 00:00:27.344
Everything is end of day, priced at the last close, and it is all one screen.

00:00:27.720 --> 00:00:31.584
The tape runs along the top.

00:00:31.584 --> 00:00:35.448
First the index level, then every security and its move on the day.

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:38.344
On the left, the watchlist.

00:00:38.344 --> 00:00:40.888
Every company on that market.

00:00:40.888 --> 00:00:43.432
Click a name to load it.

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:51.432
On the right, the session at a glance: advances and declines, top gainers, top losers, most active.

00:00:51.800 --> 00:00:55.544
It is keyboard first.

00:00:55.544 --> 00:00:59.288
Type a ticker, a panel code, or both.

00:00:59.288 --> 00:01:03.032
M T N, space, F I N, opens MTN's financials.

00:01:03.400 --> 00:01:06.544
Heatmap.

00:01:06.544 --> 00:01:09.688
Every sector, sized by weight, coloured by the day's move.

00:01:10.040 --> 00:01:14.528
Financials.

00:01:14.528 --> 00:01:19.016
Income statement, balance sheet and cash flow, from company filings, with the ratios worked out.

00:01:19.400 --> 00:01:23.588
News.

00:01:23.588 --> 00:01:27.776
Press headlines, the regulator wire, dividends and book closures, one wire per market.

00:01:28.160 --> 00:01:33.068
The screener filters and exports.

00:01:33.068 --> 00:01:37.976
Beside it: commodities, bonds, foreign exchange, time and sales, and ratings.

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:43.496
The full written guide is on the site, under Guide in the top navigation.

00:01:43.840 --> 00:01:46.552
MX Terminal.

00:01:46.552 --> 00:01:49.264
Every African market, one terminal.

